    "text": "<div class=creature>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-title\"><span>{{!!title}}</span><span>4级 蛮战</span></div>\n<div class=bg-title><span>中型 元素界 魔法兽（土系，水系）</span><span>XP {{!!xp}}</span></div>\n<div><span>''HP'' 63；''重伤'' 31</span><span>''先攻'' +4</span></div>\n<div><span>''AC'' 16，''强韧'' 17，''反射'' 15，''意志'' 15</span><span>''侦查'' +9</span></div>\n<div><span>''免疫'' 疾病，毒素</span><span>''感官'' 昏暗视觉</span></div>\n<div><span>''速度'' 5</span><span></span></div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">特性</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">无情攻势</div>\n<div class=description>烂泥鞭打者对迟缓或定身生物的攻击骰获得+2 加值。</div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">标准动作</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">{{$:/dnd/images/meleebasic}}击打✦随意</div>\n<div class=description>攻击：+7 vs. AC<br>命中：2d8+4 伤害。</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">{{$:/dnd/images/meleebasic}}淹没击打✦遭遇</div>\n<div class=description>攻击：+5 vs. 强韧<br>命中：2d8+4 伤害，以及 5 点持续伤害（豁免终止）。<br>失手：一半伤害。</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">{{$:/dnd/images/range}}泥球✦随意</div>\n<div class=description>攻击：射程 10，+5 vs. 反射<br>命中：目标迟缓（豁免终止）。如果目标已经迟缓，则它改为定身（豁免终止）。</div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">触发动作</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">不定形体✦遭遇</div>\n<div class=description>触发：当被一次近战攻击命中时。<br>该烂泥鞭打者快步 3 格。</div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span style=flex-basis:auto>''技能'' 隐秘+9</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span>''力量'' 18（+6）</span><span>''敏捷'' 15（+4）</span><span>''感知'' 15（+4）</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span>''体质'' 13（+3）</span><span>''智力'' 8（+1）</span><span>''魅力'' 11（+2）</span></div></div>\n<div><div class=\"ability\"><span>''阵营'' 无</span><span style=flex-basis:auto>''语言'' 荒神语</span></div></div>\n</div>",
